# SHUTTERBUG: the true boss's shards circle its core and soak up shots; a
# photo of the core makes them unwind and wander the screen, and the core
# can be hurt until they come back. Beating it is the Alien goal and the
# true ending.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat letters 7
cheat stage 6
cheat lives 5
cheat god
cheat flash 0
botplay 500
expect foes_35 == 1
expect foes_36 == 8
expect hp_35 == 200
expect kalei_phase == 0
botuntil kalei_phase == 1 1500
expect open_35 == 1
botuntil hp_35 < 200 400
botuntil state == 7 8000
expect true_won == 1
expect goals & 4
expect goals & 2
